    "identifier": "moonbanes-wrath",
    "description": "<p>You imbue your weapon with the fury of the moon itself, looking to smite all who stand before you. Make 4 melee Taijutsu attacks, dealing your [Weapons damage] on each successful hit. Record the number of successful hits a creature you hit at least twice with this jutsu must make a Constitution saving throw or suffering the effects listed based on the number of times you were hit.</p>\n<p>2Hits: Affected creature is Dazed and Falls Prone.</p>\n<p>3 Hits: Affected creature gains becomes Bruised, is Dazed and falls Prone.</p>\n<p>4 Hits:  Affected creature is Staggered, Dazed and falls Prone.</p>",
